=============================================================================
QUERY 1 - TRAFFIC LOG: alle verkeer van/naar IOC-IP's   (hoofdquery)
=============================================================================
( receive_time geq '2026/09/01 00:00:00' ) and ( ( addr in 149.104.78.141 ) or ( addr in 70.172.58.168 ) or ( addr in 162.243.36.88 ) or ( addr in 173.40.135.209 ) or ( addr in 47.230.224.154 ) or ( addr in 92.118.204.229 ) or ( addr in 87.224.84.82 ) or ( addr in 23.27.143.20 ) or ( addr in 62.133.62.80 ) or ( addr in 64.94.85.67 ) or ( addr in 31.56.197.72 ) or ( addr in 45.141.21.130 ) or ( addr in 138.199.200.90 ) or ( addr in 154.217.251.226 ) or ( addr in 143.198.7.94 ) or ( addr in 157.254.167.12 ) )

Beoordeling:
- action = allow + bytes > enkele KB  -> sessie is tot stand gekomen: prioriteit.
- Inbound naar Gateway VIP            -> exploitatiepoging.
- OUTBOUND vanaf NSIP/SNIP            -> HOOG: payload-download, C2 of exfiltratie
                                         => appliance waarschijnlijk gecompromitteerd.


