=============================================================================
QUERY 3 - THREAT LOG: IOC-IP's
=============================================================================
Zelfde filter als Query 1, maar in Monitor > Logs > Threat.
Let vooral op threat-namen met "NetScaler", "Citrix", "Command Injection"
of "Generic ${IFS}". Controleer of Threat Prevention content up-to-date is
en zoek naar de Palo Alto threat-ID's voor CVE-2026-88771/88772 in
Objects > Security Profiles > Vulnerability Protection (zoek op "CVE-2026-8877").

( receive_time geq '2026/09/01 00:00:00' ) and ( ( name-of-threatid contains 'NetScaler' ) or ( name-of-threatid contains 'Citrix' ) )


