XML-API - logs exporteren voor rapportage/SIEM
=============================================================================
# 1. Job starten (traffic log, query 1)
KEY='<API-key>'
FW='<firewall-of-panorama>'
curl -sk -G "https://$FW/api/" -H "X-PAN-KEY: $KEY" \
  --data-urlencode "type=log" \
  --data-urlencode "log-type=traffic" \
  --data-urlencode "nlogs=5000" \
  --data-urlencode "query=( addr in 149.104.78.141 ) or ( addr in 45.141.21.130 ) or ( addr in 64.94.85.67 )"
#    -> response bevat <job>JOB_ID</job>

# 2. Resultaat ophalen (herhalen tot status FIN)
curl -sk -G "https://$FW/api/" -H "X-PAN-KEY: $KEY" \
  --data-urlencode "type=log" \
  --data-urlencode "action=get" \
  --data-urlencode "job-id=JOB_ID" > ioc_traffic.xml

Voor log-type=threat of log-type=url hetzelfde, met de bijbehorende query.


